WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

00:00.000 --> 00:08.620
City. A hand touches a glowing glass disc on a desk. Gold light traces a path through a city of glass towers at dusk. A woman in a white blouse walks across an office floor lit with projected interface rings, then works at a laptop beside floating glass icons.

00:08.620 --> 00:36.420
Logistics. A close-up of an eye, and a driver’s gloved hand on the wheel in a dark cab. A branded truck waits on a wet road at dawn. From the cab, the dashboard and navigation screen; behind the tail lights, on-screen labels flag a route deviation. A person follows the route on a wall of maps, a camera watches a depot at night, a fuel reading is flagged, and a camera recognises the number plate as the barrier lifts. The truck drives towards a city skyline at sunrise.

00:36.420 --> 00:47.080
Heritage. From above, a waterfall falls into a forest gorge. A woman in a dark suit stands before a waterfall in shafts of light, rain falls on ferns, and an older woman with cowrie shells in her braids looks out across the water.

00:47.080 --> 01:12.790
Fashion and dance. Women in black evening dresses stand among rings of light. Close-ups of a face and of an eye lined with gold. Dancers in cream skirts move between beams of gold light, forming kaleidoscope patterns seen from above, then dance through a sunlit field.

01:12.790 --> 01:33.040
Food. Coffee beans fall into a bowl; espresso is ground, tamped and poured, and milk is poured into latte art. A chef slices tomato and courgette, drizzles olive oil over a spiral vegetable tart and watches it bake; a fork lifts the first slice, and the chef stands at the kitchen door.

01:33.040 --> 01:44.920
Animation. In a felt-textured animated world under purple blossom, a girl with a magnifying glass finds a felt ladybird and a smiling felt ball, gasps, and falls back as the ball rolls towards her.
